/ Order by a %variable% that holds nothing fails as reading it fails anywhere: VariableNotFound.
Start
- variable.set(Name=%users%, Value=[{name: "a", age: 30}, {name: "b", age: 10}])
- list.query(List=%users%, Query={order: %field%}); on.error(Key="VariableNotFound", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")]); variable.set(Name=%sorted%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.contains(Value="field", Container=%caught%, Message="the error names the variable")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Message%)
